{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"LocalizedStringKey","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"identifier"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s43ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s32ExpressibleByStringInterpolationP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s26ExpressibleByStringLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s33ExpressibleByUnicodeScalarLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The key used to look up an entry in a strings file or strings dictionary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"file."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(stringInterpolation:)","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/init(stringLiteral:)"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralType","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/StringLiteralType","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/UnicodeScalarLiteralType"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteral-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByStringInterpolation-Implementations","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/LocalizedStringKey\/ExpressibleByStringLiteral-Implementations"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializers for several SwiftUI types – such as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Toggle"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Picker"},{"type":"text","text":" and others –  implicitly look up a localized string when you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide a string literal. When you use the initializer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Text(\"Hello\")"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI creates a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" for you and uses that to look up a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"localization of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hello"},{"type":"text","text":" string. This works because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Swift\/ExpressibleByStringLiteral"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types whose initializers take a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" usually have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a corresponding initializer that accepts a parameter that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Swift\/StringProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":". Passing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" variable to these initializers avoids localization, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usually appropriate when the variable contains a user-provided value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As a general rule, use a string literal argument when you want","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"localization, and a string variable argument when you don’t. In the case","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where you want to localize the value of a string variable, use the string to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"create a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows how to create "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instances both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with and without localization. The title parameter provided to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Section"},{"type":"text","text":" is a literal string, so SwiftUI creates a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"type":"text","text":" for it. However, the string entries in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"messageStore.today"},{"type":"text","text":" array are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" variables, so the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" views"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the list use the string values verbatim."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["List {","    Section(header: Text(\"Today\")) {","        ForEach(messageStore.today) { message in","            Text(message.title)","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the app is localized into Japanese with the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"translation of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Localizable.strings"},{"type":"text","text":" file:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"other","code":["\"Today\" = \"今日\";"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When run in Japanese, the example produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list like the following, localizing “Today” for the section header, but not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the list items."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/localizedstringkey"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/LocalizedStringKey/StringLiteralType":{"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StringLiteralType","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A type that represents a string literal.","type":"text"}],"title":"LocalizedStringKey.StringLiteralType","identifier":"doc:\/\/Ope